    "text": "**Packing list for Barcelona (next two days):** The forecast shows sunny weather both days, with highs of about 21°C (70°F) today and 22°C (72°F) tomorrow. Pack light, breathable layers for the daytime. Good choices are T-shirts or short-sleeve tops, lightweight pants or a casual skirt or dress, and comfortable walking shoes or sneakers. Bring sunglasses, a hat, and sunscreen for all the sun. The forecast had no low temperatures, so I'd also bring a light jacket or sweater for the mornings and evenings. A small daypack and a refillable water bottle will help if you're out sightseeing. Rain looks unlikely, so you can skip the umbrella and rain gear. The forecast also had no wind, humidity, or UV figures, so check a local source like AEMET before you go. The lows and the rain chance are both inferred, not forecast figures."
